WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.183 line:88%
Coach Seif shows you the Naeryeo Chagi 👀

2
00:00:03.233 --> 00:00:04.817 line:88%
That was full speed

3
00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:07.017 line:88%
1) Ready Stance (Kyorugi Junbi)
Hands up, weight in the middle.

4
00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:10.817 line:88%
2) Raise the Leg High
Swing your straight leg up high.

5
00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:13.483 line:88%
3) Drop the Heel on the Target
Drop the heel down hard.

6
00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:16.283 line:88%
4) Pull the Leg Back
Keep the leg straight all the way down to the floor.

7
00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:20.083 line:88%
5) Back to the Ready Stance
Land softly, hands up.

8
00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:21.183 line:88%
Now from another side

9
00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:26.650 line:88%
In slow motion… watch the strike

10
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.317 line:88%
And once more at full speed 💥

11
00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:31.217 line:88%
Gyeongnye! A bow to finish 🙇
